OL,3,AYellow weather warnings issued for snow
OL,4,Aas temperatures plummet
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome snow is forecast over the hills
OL,7,Fand mountains in the north over the
OL,8,Fcoming days but the wintry chill will
OL,9,Fbe fairly short-lived in the south,
OL,10,Fwhere temperatures will rebound to
OL,11,Fabove average by midweek.
